{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore your island, restore your peace. </strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve arrived on a once-beautiful island\u2014now ruined by time, trash, and neglect. But you\u2019re not alone: your dog\u2019s here too. Together, you\u2019ll clean the beaches, save animals trapped in debris, and slowly turn this forgotten place into your dream home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/f41214a55248ad22b4c91b53863c9de6.poster.avif?t=1755519134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/f41214a55248ad22b4c91b53863c9de6.webm?t=1755519134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/f41214a55248ad22b4c91b53863c9de6.mp4?t=1755519134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell junk, upgrade your tools, and use what you earn to rebuild nature. Create a cozy cabin, decorate it your way, and build a safe home for your furry companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no competition, no ticking clock. Just quiet work, satisfying progress, and a better world waiting to emerge from beneath the mess.<br><br>\ud83d\udd39 Key Features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 Clean up trash and restore the island\u2019s natural beauty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc36 Build a deep bond with your helpful dog companion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Create, decorate, and personalize your cozy cabin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc22 Rescue animals stuck in plastic, ropes, or nets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Buy fertilizer and bring dead trees back to life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 Upgrade your tools and unlock new areas of the island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a Relax and play at your own pace\u2014there\u2019s no pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Discover secrets hidden beneath the surface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/3c07c9aba815735ca3b6fe57926a3221.poster.avif?t=1755519134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/3c07c9aba815735ca3b6fe57926a3221.webm?t=1755519134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/extras/3c07c9aba815735ca3b6fe57926a3221.mp4?t=1755519134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698420?t=1755519134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/2a1046e92789ca80e23a3c79a83e6263fc0bc7a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755519134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/1520469206eefe2fcc69b37a5ef02e5acf9c18ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755519134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698420/1520469206eefe2fcc69b37a5ef02e5acf9c18ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755519134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anyt